      <p>Website + booking + WhatsApp for a hair transplant clinic in Kalyan, Maharashtra needs surgeon-credibility + facility + team + before-after library + graft-cost calculator + medical-tourism landing pages + WhatsApp inside-sales flow. Higher production value than dermatology/trichology — video-heavy + patient journey documentation. This FAQ answers 12 questions Kalyan hair transplant clinics ask.</p>
