    <div class="itdgl-faq-list" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/FAQPage">
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What does a modern hair transplant clinic website in Kalyan include?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Higher production value than dermatology/trichology: (1) Surgeon profile + credentials + technique specialisation, (2) Facility virtual tour + operating room + technology showcase, (3) FUE + FUT + DHI + Sapphire FUE procedure pages with detailed process + graft-count calculator + pricing, (4) Extensive before-after library (patient journey day 0/3mo/6mo/12mo with consent + disclaimer), (5) Video consultation booking (many patients prefer video before in-person visit + travel), (6) Medical-tourism landing pages (for Tier 2/3 + international catchment) with travel/stay/procedure package, (7) WhatsApp Cloud API inside-sales flow (high-AOV consultation qualification), (8) Long-form YouTube video embeds throughout, (9) LocalBusiness + MedicalBusiness + FAQ + VideoObject + Article schema, (10) Multilingual (Marathi + Hindi + English + optional Arabic for international).</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How much does a hair transplant clinic website cost in Kalyan?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Higher than dermatology/trichology: Boutique Rs 1-2.5L (4-6 weeks). Mid-market Rs 2.5-5L (6-10 weeks). Enterprise Rs 5-12L+ (10-16 weeks). Post-launch maintenance Rs 25K-1L/month. Higher because of video-heavy content + graft-cost calculator + medical-tourism landing pages + high production value.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What booking system integrations work for a Kalyan hair transplant clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Custom booking with graft-count-based procedure selection + video consultation + in-person consultation + medical-tourism package + WhatsApp inside-sales integration. Practo + Cliniify + custom hybrid common. Key: pre-consultation questionnaire (age + hair-loss stage + prior treatments + budget + timeline + location) + WhatsApp qualifying handoff.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How does WhatsApp Cloud API work for a Kalyan hair transplant clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Interakt/AiSensy Cloud API + dedicated inside-sales rep for high-AOV consultation qualification. Flows: welcome + hair-loss assessment + graft-count estimate + video-consultation booking + facility tour link + surgeon-credentials PDF + procedure-cost breakdown + booking confirmation + travel/stay coordination (medical-tourism) + pre-op prep + post-op care + 6-12 month growth documentation follow-up + retention. Rs 5-25K/month tooling + inside-sales rep salary.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">Should we use WordPress, Shopify, or custom for hair transplant clinic?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">WordPress + heavy plugin customisation or custom (React/Next.js) preferred for hair transplant. Rs 1-5L build. Higher production requirements (video-heavy + interactive graft calculator + medical-tourism landing pages) justify custom build for scaling clinics.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What Core Web Vitals + SEO essentials for hair transplant clinic websites?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Same base + video-heavy content requires image + video optimisation + CDN. Comprehensive procedure silo (FUE + FUT + DHI + Sapphire + graft-count + cost calculator + patient journey). Medical-tourism SEO pages (city-specific: hair transplant Delhi + Mumbai + Bangalore + Dubai + London → all pointing to Kalyan clinic). Long-form YouTube embeds throughout for engagement + dwell-time SEO.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do we handle extensive before-after library + consent for hair transplant?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Comprehensive consent form pre-procedure (all future marketing + website + video + social). Documentation protocol: day 0 (pre-op) + day 7 (post-op) + 3 months + 6 months + 12 months + 18 months + 24 months + long-term maintenance. Same lighting/angle/distance + no filters + disclaimer overlay + individual-variation caveat + consent-obtained badge. Categorised by graft count + technique + age + hair-loss stage. Faces blurred if patient prefers. Consent revocable.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What booking conversion rate for a Kalyan hair transplant clinic website?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">3-7% booking-inquiry conversion (lower than dermatology/trichology due to higher AOV + longer consideration). First-time 1.5-4%. Returning 6-15%. Referral 10-25%. Video consultation option adds 30-50% booking conversion. Medical-tourism landing pages add 20-40% conversion for out-of-city buyers.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">How do we integrate reviews + patient success stories for hair transplant website?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Google Business Profile reviews embedded. Long-form YouTube patient testimonials + before-after journey videos (with consent). Text testimonials with signed consent + verified. Review generation via 3-month + 6-month + 12-month post-procedure WhatsApp asking for Google review. Target 50-200 Google reviews/year for competitive Kalyan hair transplant clinic. Higher-quality video reviews > text — hair transplant buyer trust requires visual proof.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What ongoing maintenance for hair transplant clinic website?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">Rs 25K-1L/month + long-cycle patient documentation additions + before-after library growth (day 3mo → 6mo → 12mo → 18mo → 24mo per patient) + surgeon technique videos + facility content refresh + medical-tourism landing page updates + blog + Core Web Vitals audit. Bundled with retainer.</div>
      </div>
      <div class="itdgl-faq-item">
        <h2 class="itdgl-faq-q">What common website mistakes do Kalyan hair transplant clinics make?</h2>
        <div class="itdgl-faq-a">(1) Weak video production (fatal for surgical credibility). (2) No graft-count calculator. (3) No medical-tourism landing pages. (4) Weak before-after library (poor documentation). (5) No WhatsApp inside-sales flow. (6) Missing surgeon credentials + facility content. (7) English-only in Kalyan. (8) Slow site (video-heavy without CDN). (9) No video-consultation booking. (10) No long-form YouTube integration. (11) Aggressive discount marketing. (12) Weak local SEO for Kalyan pincode.</div>
      </div>
